#: /usr/bin/anduinos-appearance:533
msgid ""
"1. Approximate location (ipapi.co)\n"
"AnduinOS will make one HTTPS request to ipapi.co. Its operator, Kloudend, "
"Inc., will see your public IP address and may use it to estimate your city, "
"country, and approximate coordinates.\n"
"\n"
"2. Weather data (Open-Meteo)\n"
"The weather extension will send the selected approximate coordinates to Open-"
"Meteo, operated by OpenMeteo GmbH. The service will also see your public IP "
"address and may retain API logs for up to 90 days.\n"
"\n"
"AnduinOS is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by either third-"
"party service. If location detection fails, AnduinOS will use an offline "
"estimate based on your system timezone.\n"
"\n"
"Privacy policies:\n"
"https://ipapi.co/privacy/\n"
"https://open-meteo.com/en/terms"
msgstr ""
"1. Približna lokacija (ipapi.co)\n"
"AnduinOS će poslati jedan HTTPS zahtjev usluzi ipapi.co. Njezin operator, "
"Kloudend, Inc., vidjet će vašu javnu IP adresu i može je upotrijebiti za "
"procjenu vašeg grada, države i približnih koordinata.\n"
"\n"
"2. Vremenski podaci (Open-Meteo)\n"
"Proširenje za vremensku prognozu poslat će odabrane približne koordinate "
"usluzi Open-Meteo, kojom upravlja OpenMeteo GmbH. Usluga će također vidjeti "
"vašu javnu IP adresu i može zadržati zapise API-ja do 90 dana.\n"
"\n"
"AnduinOS nije povezan ni s jednom od tih usluga treće strane, ne sponzorira "
"ih niti ih podržava. Ako određivanje lokacije ne uspije, AnduinOS će "
"upotrijebiti izvanmrežnu procjenu na temelju vremenske zone sustava.\n"
"\n"
"Pravila privatnosti:\n"
"https://ipapi.co/privacy/\n"
"https://open-meteo.com/en/terms"

